From fb044c62b60fe5533d3157c6cbaeff4463bb3dcb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "GONG, Ruiqi" <gongruiqi1@huawei.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Oct 2022 19:19:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 0593/1076] [Huawei] selinux: genfscon: add a config for this
 feature

Offering: HULK
hulk inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: 186697

----------------------------------------

An option CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX_GENFSCON_NS is added to control the
enabling of the SELinux Genfscon Label Namespace feature in compilation.

Signed-off-by: GONG, Ruiqi <gongruiqi1@huawei.com>
